class_name WallRunGap
extends Marker3D
## Marks a Gap too long to jump, with a wall alongside that the Runner Wall-runs to cross it.
## Placed like a [Gap]: at its near edge, in the middle across, running along -Z to the floor
## beyond, at the height of the floor it is jumped from: floor height 0, or the top of a Block
## right before it. The floor and the wall make the Wall-run gap, not this marker.
